          "merchant"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "伊班的权贵把卡萨当作议事与港口利益的枢纽，也防着它把共同决策变成自家命令。寒海不会因一个姓氏而平静，出航判断错一次便可能动摇多年威望。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": [
          "ibbenese"
        ],
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
          "sailor",
